<p>In April and May 1994, two new original songs written by <strong>Marcelo Nicchio</strong> were taken into <strong>Estúdio Anonimato</strong> in São Paulo to record what became Coitado do Próximo’s first demo tape, later duplicated in hundreds of copies for promotional distribution.</p><p>Each side of the tape carried one song: <strong>Side A:</strong> <em>Mulher SP</em>; <strong>Side B:</strong> <em>Pegue o Seu Celular</em>.</p><p><strong>Lineup:</strong> Mario Joe (vocals), Ricá (guitar and backing vocals), Henrique (bass), Marcelo Minduim (drums) and Adriano (harmonica).</p><figure class="thread-media thread-media--pair"><div class="thread-media-pair__images"><a aria-label="Open AI reconstruction 1 from the first demo-tape sessions at full size" href="/assets/archive/music/coitado-do-proximo/1994-primeira-demo-tape-estudio-anonimato/anonimato_01_thread_AI_300kb.jpg" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><img alt="AI reconstruction from Coitado do Próximo’s first demo-tape sessions at Estúdio Anonimato in 1994." decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/archive/music/coitado-do-proximo/1994-primeira-demo-tape-estudio-anonimato/anonimato_01_thread_AI_300kb.jpg" width="1448" height="1086"/></a><a aria-label="Open AI reconstruction 2 from the first demo-tape sessions at full size" href="/assets/archive/music/coitado-do-proximo/1994-primeira-demo-tape-estudio-anonimato/anonimato_03_thread_AI_300kb.jpg" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><img alt="AI reconstruction from Coitado do Próximo’s first demo-tape sessions at Estúdio Anonimato in 1994." decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/archive/music/coitado-do-proximo/1994-primeira-demo-tape-estudio-anonimato/anonimato_03_thread_AI_300kb.jpg" width="1448" height="1086"/></a></div><figcaption><strong>Estúdio Anonimato · first demo tape · Apr./May 1994.</strong><span class="thread-media-note">Two illustrative AI reconstructions/restorations made from images in the original footage, which survives in low quality.</span><span class="thread-media-pair__open"><a class="thread-media-open" href="/assets/archive/music/coitado-do-proximo/1994-primeira-demo-tape-estudio-anonimato/anonimato_01_thread_AI_300kb.jpg" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Open image 1 ↗</a><a class="thread-media-open" href="/assets/archive/music/coitado-do-proximo/1994-primeira-demo-tape-estudio-anonimato/anonimato_03_thread_AI_300kb.jpg" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Open image 2 ↗</a></span></figcaption></figure><!-- gallery:primeira-demo-tape-anonimato-1994:start -->
